- `SKELETON_COUNT = 6` constant as specified
- Loads books via `fetchBooks()` from `./api` on mount using `useEffect`
- Passes `books` and `skeletonCount` to `ShelfGrid`
- Named export (`App`) per the TS constraint on preferring named exports
- No inline I/O — the adapter call lives in `api.ts`, component just calls it

